%% Weekend 2.0 - Text chat request flow. FigJam: https://www.figma.com/board/pMvZioGximavxDcsD14Ee9
sequenceDiagram
  title Text chat request flow
  participant Owner
  participant PhonePWA
  participant API
  participant Postgres
  participant Bedrock
  participant CalendarAPI
  Owner->>PhonePWA: Type message
  PhonePWA->>API: POST /chat over tailnet
  API->>Postgres: Check session, load history and memories
  Postgres-->>API: Context rows
  API->>Bedrock: Prompt with tools, stream
  Bedrock-->>API: Tool call calendar.list_events
  API->>CalendarAPI: Read-only events query
  CalendarAPI-->>API: Events
  API->>Bedrock: Tool result
  Bedrock-->>API: Streamed answer
  API-->>PhonePWA: SSE stream
  API->>Postgres: Save turn, memories, audit entry
  PhonePWA-->>Owner: Show answer
